      "title": "Rank skew: policy_ppo_train across ranks",
      "description": "Spread of policy_ppo_train across one step's ranks. The max-to-p50 gap is the straggler skew the driver pays for. Do not subtract it from the driver's policy_train — that waits for the last rank to return, not the longest-running one.",
