      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SM and tensor-pipe activity on this run's nodes",
      "description": "DCGM SM-active against tensor-active on this run's nodes. The direct test of whether the eager MoE loop is launch-bound: SM-active stays high while the device does very little, so tensor-active near zero underneath it is the signature. Joined by node, never per rank.",
